sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Admin Dashboard
    participant API as Backend Views (Django)
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    
    Admin->>UI: Click "Calculate Ranks"
    UI->>API: PUT /api/events/{id}/ (results_published=True)
    API->>DB: Update Event
    DB-->>API: Success
    API-->>UI: 200 OK
    UI->>API: GET /api/events/{id}/rankings/
    API->>DB: Fetch Posters & Evaluations
    DB-->>API: Return Records
    API->>API: Average Scores, Sort, & Assign Ranks
    API-->>UI: Return Ranked List JSON
    UI-->>Admin: Render Leaderboard UI
